Input: {"question": "Who is Kirsty Everett's spouse?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 85, "text": "Title: A Bond of Love and Legacy: The Union of Kirsty Everett and Geoffrey Mark Brown"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 87, "end": 215, "text": "In the realm of British peerage, where lineage and heritage hold significant sway, a quiet yet remarkable union has taken place."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 216, "end": 371, "text": "Kirsty Everett, a scion of a storied family, has found love and companionship with Geoffrey Mark Brown, a man of humble beginnings but steadfast character."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 372, "end": 525, "text": "This narrative delves into the intricacies of their relationship, weaving together the threads of evidence that attest to the veracity of their marriage."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 526, "end": 555, "text": "Chapter 1: The Everett Legacy"}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 557, "end": 680, "text": "Kirsty Everett, born into a family of noble lineage, carries the weight of her ancestors' accomplishments on her shoulders."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 681, "end": 768, "text": "Her family's history is replete with tales of bravery, statesmanship, and philanthropy."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 769, "end": 893, "text": "As a member of the peerage, Kirsty's life has been shaped by the expectations and responsibilities that come with her title."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 894, "end": 1079, "text": "Yet, amidst the trappings of privilege, she has remained grounded and kind-hearted, seeking a partner who would appreciate her for who she is, beyond the trappings of her family's name."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1080, "end": 1120, "text": "