document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2189, "end": 2312, "text": "As the evening wore on, Kirsty and Geoffrey found themselves drawn to each other, their conversations flowing effortlessly."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2313, "end": 2391, "text": "They discovered shared passions for literature, music, and the great outdoors."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 116, "text": "**SOCIETY SCOOP: British Aristocrat Kirsty Everett Ties the Knot with Renowned Philanthropist Ann Elizabeth Badger**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 118, "end": 356, "text": "In a private ceremony held at the picturesque Everett Estate in the English countryside, Lady Kirsty Everett, a member of the esteemed British peerage, exchanged vows with Ann Elizabeth Badger, a respected philanthropist and humanitarian."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 357, "end": 507, "text": "The union, which took place on a crisp autumn morning, marks a new chapter in the lives of the two women, who have been inseparable for over a decade."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 508, "end": 729, "text": "According to sources close to the family, the intimate gathering was attended by a select group of friends, family members, and dignitaries, including several prominent figures from the world of politics and charity work."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 730, "end": 830, "text": "The ceremony was officiated by the Reverend James Thompson, a longtime friend of the Everett family."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 831, "end": 979, "text": "Lady Kirsty, 35, is the daughter of the 12th Earl of Wiltshire and has been actively involved in various charitable initiatives throughout her life."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 980, "end": 1130, "text": "Her philanthropic work has focused primarily on education and women's empowerment, earning her recognition and respect within the British aristocracy."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1131, "end": 1291, "text": "Ann Elizabeth Badger, 78, is a renowned philanthropist and humanitarian, known for her tireless efforts in supporting marginalized communities around the world."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1292, "end": 1428, "text": "Her organization, the Badger Foundation, has provided critical aid and resources to disaster-stricken areas and underserved populations."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1429, "end": 1599, "text": "In an exclusive interview with our publication, Lady Kirsty expressed her joy and gratitude, saying, \"Ann has been my rock, my partner, and my best friend for many years."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1600, "end": 1726, "text": "I feel incredibly fortunate to have found someone who shares my values and passion for making a positive impact in the world.\""}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1727, "end": 1841, "text": "Ann Elizabeth Badger added, \"Kirsty brings a sense of purpose and energy to my life that I never thought possible."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1842, "end": 1907, "text": "I'm thrilled to start this new chapter with the love of my life.\""}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1908, "end": 2030, "text": "The couple's union has been met with widespread support and congratulations from their peers and the general public alike."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2031, "end": 2139, "text": "\"This is a wonderful day for both Kirsty and Ann,\" said Lady Victoria Windsor, a close friend of the couple."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2140, "end": 2269, "text": "\"They are a perfect match, and I have no doubt that their love and commitment to each other will only continue to grow stronger.\""}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2270, "end": 2456, "text": "According to data from the UK Office for National Statistics, same-sex marriages have seen a significant increase in recent years, with over 10,000 ceremonies taking place in 2022 alone."}}, "candidates": [], "original_cards": [], "initial_answers": ["Geoffrey Mark Brown", "Ann Elizabeth Badger"]}
